{"hw":"εἰσίημι","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">εἰσίημι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">εἰσίημι</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ήσω</span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-ῆκα</span>:—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sendinto,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἐς τὴν [λίμνην] εἰ. τὸὕδωρ,</span> of rivers, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.109</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">εἰ. τοὺς Πέρσας ἐς τὸ τεῖχος</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">let</b> them <b class=\"lex-tr\">in,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.158</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὴν [κεδρίην]</span> (sc. <span class=\"gk\">ἐς τὴν κοιλίην</span>) <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.87</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς πολεμίους ἔφη εἰσέσθαι</span> said he <b class=\"lex-tr\">had let</b> them <b class=\"lex-tr\">in,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.3.19</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">χάριτας</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sammelb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4324.8</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.115.18</span> </span> (Lex Dracontis). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Med.</span> </span>, <span class=\"gk\">αὖλιν ἐσιέμεναι</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">betaking themselves into their own</b> ro